## Rules

{{entry("Added", "New capabilities, described from the reader's point of view.")}}
{{entry("Fixed", "User-visible bugs, with the symptom named first.")}}
{{entry("Changed", "Behavior differences someone upgrading would notice.")}}

## Voice sample

The formatter treats everything below a directive as body text and never
rewrites it. The fenced block, its interior blank line, and this paragraph
survive `mds fmt` byte-for-byte:

```text
Before: the thing was slow

After:  the thing is fast
```

Keep entries short. One idea per line.
